# Line endings
#
# Text files are stored with LF in the repository, whatever line endings they
# have in the working tree. Each developer's working tree keeps following their
# own core.autocrlf/core.eol setting; only what is committed is normalized.

* text=auto

# Always text, even where Git's heuristic might decide otherwise.
*.tex text
*.bib text
*.md  text

# Never convert these.
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
